 \item\label{alg4:actI} Drop all literals involving any function variable.

 \end{enumerate}

\end{enumerate} 

We have thus eliminated all function variables originally occurring in $\fhi_0$; the resulting formula ${\fhi}_4$ can now be tested for satisfiability using Tarski's method.

